@cc [owner:nareshshah139,label:security] declared-clinic-staff-boundary
Controllers declaring the clinic staff policy MUST deny patient and lab technician roles,
except on routes explicitly declared public or authenticated and independently scoped.

@cc [owner:nareshshah139,label:security] portal-principal-boundary
Routes under /portal MUST take their scope only from the principal PortalGuard builds.
OwnDataOnly: a portal principal reads and writes only its own patient's data, and no portal
route accepts a patient id. LinkAnswersOnly: a task-link principal reads only the questions of
its OPEN check-ins and writes only their responses; it reads no stored answer.
StaffCookieStaysStaff: a staff cookie or JWT never makes a portal principal, and a portal
credential never authorises a staff route.
